      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "BqYiH_NBHtsDCKHqJCDZI",
      "originalText": "Dynamic SQL\nProgram builds a query as a\nstring AT RUNTIME, submits it,\nand fetches results tuple-by-tuple",
